- Extract the tracker factory into a separate function `makeTaTracker(rec, trackerApi)`.
- Extract configLoader factory into `makeTaConfigLoader(rec, mocks)`.
- Extract globals setup into `makeTaGlobals(rec, mocks)`.
- Optionally replace ternaries with default no-op implementations: e.g. `var getIssueImpl = trackerApi.getIssue || function() { return null; };` — but that adds branches too if inside loadTaModule; if extracted into separate small functions each with CC ≤ 7, fine.

